{"summary":"静态阅读学生代码：函数使用 csv.DictReader 解析，检查必需表头，逐行校验 record_id 与 duration_minutes，并区分未知分钟与已知 0 分钟，最后返回五个整数字段。未发现外部 I/O 或明显计数、累加错误；材料仅含该函数，未执行任何代码。","overall":"pass","criteria":[{"criterion_id":"C01","verdict":"pass","reason":"代码在读取 fieldnames 后检查必需列 record_id 与 duration_minutes 是否齐全，缺失时抛出 ValueError，符合表头约束。","evidence_span":"if reader.fieldnames is None or not required.issubset(reader.fieldnames):
        raise ValueError("missing required headers")","suggested_self_test":"用仅含 record_id,minutes 表头的 CSV 调用函数，确认抛出 ValueError。","next_action":null},{"criterion_id":"C02","verdict":"pass","reason":"使用 csv.DictReader 处理引号与空白物理行；对每行校验 record_id 可解析且大于 0、分钟空白或可解析且范围 0 至 1440，非法行计入 invalid_count 并跳过。","evidence_span":"rid = int(row["record_id"].strip())
            raw = row["duration_minutes"].strip()
            duration = None if raw == "" else int(raw)
            if rid <= 0 or (duration is not None and not 0 <= duration <= 1440):
                raise ValueError("out of range")","suggested_self_test":"构造包含合法行、record_id 为 0、分钟为 -1、1441、1.5 的 CSV，确认仅合法行计入有效行，其余计入 invalid_count。","next_action":null},{"criterion_id":"C03","verdict":"pass","reason":"有效行先增加 record_count；分钟为 None 时增加 missing_duration_count，否则增加 known_duration_count，已知 0 分钟不会被当作未知。","evidence_span":"if duration is None:
            out["missing_duration_count"] += 1
        else:
            out["known_duration_count"] += 1","suggested_self_test":"输入一行分钟为 0 和一行分钟为空白的 CSV，确认 known_duration_count 为 1、missing_duration_count 为 1、record_count 为 2。","next_action":null},{"criterion_id":"C04","verdict":"pass","reason":"仅在分钟已知时把 duration 累加到 known_minutes，未知分钟不参与累加，已知 0 分钟累加 0 不影响结果。","evidence_span":"out["known_minutes"] += duration","suggested_self_test":"输入分钟为 1440 与 0 的两行，确认 known_minutes 为 1440。","next_action":null},{"criterion_id":"C05","verdict":"pass","reason":"返回字典在循环前已初始化五个整数字段，即使没有有效行也会返回完整五字段。","evidence_span":"out = {"record_count": 0, "known_duration_count": 0, "known_minutes": 0,
           "missing_duration_count": 0, "invalid_count": 0}","suggested_self_test":"输入只有表头、没有数据行的 CSV，确认返回五个字段且值均为 0。","next_action":null},{"criterion_id":"C06","verdict":"pass","reason":"函数只使用 csv 与 io 在内存中解析字符串，未读写文件、未联网、未执行任意代码，符合纯函数边界。","evidence_span":"reader = csv.DictReader(io.StringIO(csv_text))","suggested_self_test":"静态检查函数体，确认没有 open、网络请求或 eval/exec 等调用。","next_action":null}]}
